  "prefLabel": "Inst 701.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 701.01 Purpose.\n\n(a) The purpose of this chapter is to assure the proper installation of manufactured housing as defined by RSA 205-D:1, XI.\n\n(b) Installers have the option of installing in accordance with:\n\n(1) This chapter;\n\n(2) A design prepared by a New Hampshire licensed engineer or architect; or\n\n(3) The manufacturer’s installation standards.\n\nSource. #14221, eff 2-25-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/inst100-700.html"
}
